{"3435530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Double Dangerous", "steam_appid": 3435530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/29d042ea48907bb4019f11cd688865fe.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=81 /></span><br><br><strong>Double Dangerous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to lock, load, and double the chaos! Double Dangerous is a high-octane third-person shooter that flips the script on traditional gameplay. Wield dual guns and unleash a storm of bullets in any direction—regardless of where your character is facing. Run forward while blasting behind you, pull off wild one-arm shots, or take down enemies mid-dive in slow motion. The choice is yours, and the fun is limitless.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/9fddf0be76f0d77689b4f98b82021652.poster.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/9fddf0be76f0d77689b4f98b82021652.webm?t=1740742607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Shooting Mechanics: Aim and fire freely in all directions, adding strategy and flair to every firefight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unique Worlds: Explore diverse environments, each packed with vibrant visuals and dynamic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Difficulty Modes: From Easy to the insane “Nuts” mode, push your skills to the limit with extra missions and escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medals and Unlockable Items: Earn medals in every mode to unlock exclusive skins and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Inspired Style: Enjoy a blend of cartoonish charm and sleek realism, brought to life with stunning lighting and dynamic sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/5f9d1be042509e73d15eb3f127ad8645.poster.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/5f9d1be042509e73d15eb3f127ad8645.webm?t=1740742607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a casual player looking for a good time or a hardcore gamer chasing the ultimate challenge, Double Dangerous delivers non-stop action, endless replay-ability, and the satisfaction of outgunning the odds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/2e1fd9ab1ee2266d61fa97d04144cb4d.poster.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/2e1fd9ab1ee2266d61fa97d04144cb4d.webm?t=1740742607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/29d042ea48907bb4019f11cd688865fe.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=81 /></span><br><br><strong>Double Dangerous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to lock, load, and double the chaos! Double Dangerous is a high-octane third-person shooter that flips the script on traditional gameplay. Wield dual guns and unleash a storm of bullets in any direction—regardless of where your character is facing. Run forward while blasting behind you, pull off wild one-arm shots, or take down enemies mid-dive in slow motion. The choice is yours, and the fun is limitless.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/9fddf0be76f0d77689b4f98b82021652.poster.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/9fddf0be76f0d77689b4f98b82021652.webm?t=1740742607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Shooting Mechanics: Aim and fire freely in all directions, adding strategy and flair to every firefight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unique Worlds: Explore diverse environments, each packed with vibrant visuals and dynamic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Difficulty Modes: From Easy to the insane “Nuts” mode, push your skills to the limit with extra missions and escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medals and Unlockable Items: Earn medals in every mode to unlock exclusive skins and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Inspired Style: Enjoy a blend of cartoonish charm and sleek realism, brought to life with stunning lighting and dynamic sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435530/extras/5f9d1be042509e73d15eb3f127ad8645.poster.avif?t=1740742607\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.a